l","patternMeaning":"나는 ...하는 데 익숙하지 않다","patternTip":"Personal state","sourceOriginalDay":27,"sourceOriginalNo":14,"uniqueId":"T_D10_04","englishMeaning":"unite, unify, synthesize, interconnect, consolidate","pos":"v.","memoryKo":"integrate = 통합하다, 합치다"},{"word":"intensify","meaning":"강화하다","rating":3,"collocation":"I'll see ...","example":"I'll see if the storm will intensify tonight.","translation":"오늘 밤 폭풍이 심해질지 확인해볼게.","question":"What will the speaker check tonight?","questionKo":"화자는 오늘 밤 무엇을 확인할 건가요?","collocations2":["intensify the storm"],"synonyms":[["reinforce","강화하다"],["strengthen","강화하다"],["enhance","향상시키다"]],"collocationsKo":[],"newDay":10,"newNo":5,"theme":"People & Feelings","themeKo":"사람과 감정 표현하기","priorityScore":53.0,"priorityBand":"Bridge","originalDay":17,"originalNo":9,"icon":"cloud","bg":"linear-gradient(135deg,#0f766e,#2563eb)","phrase":"I'll see ...","ko":"강화하다","synonymUsed":"","paraphrase":"I'll check whether the storm gets stronger tonight.","paraphraseLabel":"패러프레이징 예문","paraphraseTranslation":"오늘 밤 폭풍이 더 강해지는지 확인하겠다.","pack":"toefl","patternMeaning":"내가 확인해볼게...","patternTip":"Promise","sourceOriginalDay":17,"sourceOriginalNo":9,"uniqueId":"T_D10_05","englishMeaning":"reinforce, strengthen, enhance","pos":"v.","memoryKo":"intensify = 강화되다, 심해지다"},{"word":"interlock","meaning":"서로 맞물리다","rating":3,"collocation":"I'll let you know ...","example":"I'll let you know when the gears interlock.","translation":"톱니들이 맞물릴 때 알려줄게.","question":"When will the speaker inform the listener?","questionKo":"언제 화자는 듣는 사람에게 알릴 건가요?","collocations2":["gears interlock"],"synonyms":[["link","관계, 유대; 관련짓다"],["connect","연결하다"]],"collocationsKo":[],"newDay":10,"newNo":6,"theme":"People & Feelings","themeKo":"사람과 감정 표현하기","priorityScore":53.0,"priorityBand":"Bridge","originalDay":15,"originalNo":20,"icon":"gear","bg":"linear-gradient(135deg,#0f766e,#2563eb)","phrase":"I'll let you know ...","ko":"서로 맞물리다","synonymUsed":"","paraphrase":"I'll inform you once the pa